# Flow

Before any styling change, read `flow/skills/flow-principles/SKILL.md` and pass the intent gate: purpose, primary action, reading order, density class. State the answers in the response.

Every finding and every change cites a taxonomy ID, `FLOW-01` to `FLOW-12`.

Reviewing → `flow/skills/flow-audit/SKILL.md`
Restyling → `flow/skills/flow-apply/SKILL.md`
Scale work → `flow/skills/flow-tokens/SKILL.md`

Reference files under `flow/references/` load on demand only.

Contrast ratios, scale membership, and measure are computed, never estimated:

```
python3 flow/scripts/contrast.py "#FG" "#BG"
python3 flow/scripts/scan_tokens.py <path>
```

Appearance only. Logic, state, routing, and data flow are out of scope. If a fix would change behaviour, surface it as a question instead of making it.
